• New: LUKS1 and LUKS2 encrypted volumes now supported alongside VeraCrypt
• New: ext2/3/4 supported — ext4 read/write, ext2/3 read-only, FAT32/exFAT unchanged
• New: On ext4: create, write, modify, delete and rename files and directories
• New: Volume picker lists only partitions you can unlock, tagged by encryption type
• Fixed: Unencrypted partitions were mislabelled "VERACRYPT" and failed to unlock
• Fixed: Encrypted partition unreachable on a drive with unencrypted ones too
